a natural and immersive learning experience while maintaining awareness of the surrounding environment.\n\nKey Features\n\n\u2022 Mixed Reality-based CPR training\n\u2022 AED education and emergency response training\n\u2022 Seamless integration of virtual training content with the real environment\n\u2022 Intuitive hand-based interaction\n\u2022 Designed for schools, hospitals, emergency services, and corporate safety training\n\u2022 Repeatable training sessions that enhance learning effectiveness\n\nReaLive MR enhances conventional CPR education by providing a safe, immersive, and highly interactive training environment that helps learners develop practical life-saving skills and emergency response capabilities.\n\nDeveloped by TechSan Co., Ltd., ReaLive MR combines advanced Mixed Reality technology with immersive CPR education to deliver realistic and effective emergency response training.", "short_description": "ReaLive MR is a Mixed Reality CPR training solution that enables immersive CPR and AED education using Meta Quest devices."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\ub85c\uace0_\uc228\ud130\uce58 1024_1024.png", "id": "1592341982239556", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_1592341985572889_6947409751023236525_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m8tNB4uizngQ7kNvwGfROL2&_nc_oc=AdqyqIB_TsWcGlRUhSW2c6zFUR2_xihXZGN8Le27w-nvN5ih9NfOT87WXhjfPxPHMvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC6dHH2WLNv_1MAL2qokLjKm4_Qi5tPGdI-78QgPudcoQ&oe=6A6C99FF"}, {"file_name": "\uc228\ud130\uce58_\ub300\ud45c_3000x900_Safe area.png", "id": "1306835034770003", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_1306835038103336_6820841876092211466_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MI6Wrga-970Q7kNvwEJ2VSl&_nc_oc=AdrT5dNs9g3ScLe10WCTbO1vPWdkoSzdPW-B_bmJ9uyjzsgqhH1lQ7tjzGpK9EiDXBE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-